{"step_index":197,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T19:09:31Z","thinking":"**Initiating Execution Phase**\n\nGreat news! The implementation plan was approved, so I've moved into the execution phase. I'm starting with the backend implementation in `app.py`. The first step is configuring the `SUBSCRIPTION_PLAN`.\n\n\n**Defining Subscription Plan & Auth**\n\nI've defined the `SUBSCRIPTION_PLAN` object, specifying pricing, benefits, and identifiers. I've also implemented the HMAC-SHA256 signed session token generation/verification using `DEMO_SESSION_SECRET`. The `create_session_token` function now crafts the base64 encoded JSON payload and signature. I've also constructed the `verify_paid_session` FastAPI security dependency, checking cookies for the session token.\n\n\n**Implementing Authentication and Routing**\n\nI'm now integrating the authentication and session management. I've added a number of critical endpoints: `/api/session` to read the session cookie, `/api/demo-payment` to simulate the payment process, and `/api/logout` and `/api/reset-demo` to clear the session. I've also set up the logic to protect certain API endpoints with the `verify_paid_session` dependency. Finally, I've defined the HTML file responses for key pages.\n\n\n**Designing Payment Gateway Sim**\n\nI'm now implementing the payment gateway simulation. I've designed the checkout page to simulate EcoCash, Visa, and MasterCard payments. The checkout collects `method`, `plan_id`, and `email` and sends these to the `/api/demo-payment` endpoint. On payment approval, it sets a session cookie and redirects to `/library`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import base64\\nimport hashlib\\nimport hmac\\nimport json\\nimport logging\\nimport os\\nimport shutil\\nimport time\\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nfrom typing import List, Optional\\n\\nfrom fastapi import Depends, FastAPI, HTTPException, Path as PathParam, Query, Request, Response, status\\nfrom fastapi.responses import FileResponse\\nfrom fastapi.staticfiles import StaticFiles\\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel, Field\\n\\n# Configure structured Python logger\\nlogging.basicConfig(\\n    level=logging.INFO, format=\\\"%(asctime)s [%(levelname)s] %(name)s: %(message)s\\\"\\n)\\nlogger = logging.getLogger(\\\"streamwave\\\")\\n\\nBASE_DIR = Path(__file__).resolve().parent\\nDATA_FILE = BASE_DIR / \\\"data\\\" / \\\"media.json\\\"\\nPUBLIC_DIR = BASE_DIR / \\\"public\\\"\\nMEDIA_DIR = PUBLIC_DIR / \\\"media\\\"\\nIMAGES_DIR = PUBLIC_DIR / \\\"images\\\"\\n\\nPREVIEW_VIDEO_FILE = MEDIA_DIR / \\\"streamwave-preview.mp4\\\"\\nLOGO_IMAGE_FILE = IMAGES_DIR / \\\"streamwave-logo.png\\\"\\n\\n# Centralized Subscription Plan Configuration\\nSUBSCRIPTION_PLAN = {\\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"streamwave-monthly\\\",\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"StreamWave Monthly\\\",\\n    \\\"price\\\": \\\"US$2.99 per month\\\",\\n    \\\"price_amount\\\": 2.99,\\n    \\\"currency\\\": \\\"USD\\\",\\n    \\\"interval\\\": \\\"month\\\",\\n    \\\"benefits\\\": [\\n        \\\"Full Zimbabwean catalogue access\\\",\\n        \\\"5-second MP4 movie previews\\\",\\n        \\\"Demonstration music audio samples\\\",\\n        \\\"Access on desktop or mobile\\\",\\n    ],\\n}\\n\\n# Session Cookie Signing Secret\\nDEMO_SESSION_SECRET = os.getenv(\\n    \\\"DEMO_SESSION_SECRET\\\", \\\"streamwave-secret-key-academic-demo-2026\\\"\\n).encode(\\\"utf-8\\\")\\n\\n\\ndef create_session_token(email: str, expiry_seconds: int = 86400 * 7) -> str:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Generates an HMAC-SHA256 signed session token for a paid demonstration member.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    payload = {\\n        \\\"email\\\": email.strip().lower(),\\n        \\\"plan_id\\\": SUBSCRIPTION_PLAN[\\\"id\\\"],\\n        \\\"exp\\\": int(time.time()) + expiry_seconds,\\n    }\\n    json_bytes = json.dumps(payload, separators=(\\\",\\\", \\\":\\\")).encode(\\\"utf-8\\\n<truncated 17465 bytes>","Description":"\"Update app.py with subscription plan configuration, signed HTTP-only cookie authentication, checkout endpoint, and access control dependency\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\dell\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\\\app.py\"","toolAction":"\"Updating app.py with session access control and payment endpoints\"","toolSummary":"\"Updating app.py with session access control and payment endpoints\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
