{"step_index":236,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T19:21:21Z","thinking":"**Defining Hero Section Styles**\n\nI'm now focusing on styling the hero section in `public/css/styles.css`. My current thinking is centered on ensuring the `.landing-hero` section is full-height using `min-height` or `calc()`, and implementing flexbox for centered content. I'm also addressing the need for a high-contrast dark overlay to ensure text readability against the collage background, specifically using `rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.88)`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"/* ==========================================================================\\n   StreamWave Entertainment - Responsive Media Platform Stylesheet\\n   Dark Graphite Theme with Restrained Red Accent & Full Accessibility\\n   ========================================================================== */\\n\\n:root {\\n    --bg-base: #121214;\\n    --bg-surface: #18181c;\\n    --bg-elevated: #222228;\\n    --bg-hover: #2e2e36;\\n    \\n    --border-color: #2e2e38;\\n    --border-focus: #e50914;\\n\\n    --text-primary: #f4f4f6;\\n    --text-secondary: #a0a0ab;\\n    --text-muted: #6e6e7a;\\n\\n    --accent-red: #e50914;\\n    --accent-red-hover: #b80710;\\n    --accent-red-subtle: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.15);\\n\\n    --font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\\n    --radius-sm: 4px;\\n    --radius-md: 6px;\\n    \\n    --shadow-card: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\\n    --shadow-dialog: 0 16px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\\n}\\n\\n/* Base Resets & Overflow Protection */\\n*, *::before, *::after {\\n    box-sizing: border-box;\\n    margin: 0;\\n    padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nhtml {\\n    overflow-x: hidden;\\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\\n}\\n\\nbody {\\n    background-color: var(--bg-base);\\n    color: var(--text-primary);\\n    font-family: var(--font-family);\\n    line-height: 1.5;\\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\\n    min-height: 100vh;\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    overflow-x: hidden;\\n}\\n\\n.library-body {\\n    padding-bottom: 110px; /* Space so fixed audio player never obscures footer */\\n}\\n\\n/* Screen Reader Only Utility Class */\\n.sr-only {\\n    position: absolute;\\n    width: 1px;\\n    height: 1px;\\n    padding: 0;\\n    margin: -1px;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\\n    white-space: nowrap;\\n    border: 0;\\n}\\n\\na {\\n    color: inherit;\\n    text-decoration: none;\\n}\\n\\nbutton, input, select {\\n    font-family: inherit;\\n    font-size: inherit;\\n}\\n\\n/* Accessibility Focus Visible */\\n*:focus-visible {\\n    outline: 2px solid var(--accent-red\n<truncated 32190 bytes>","Description":"\"Update public/css/styles.css with focus-visible, reduced-motion, and layout styles for landing and checkout refinement\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\dell\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\\\public\\\\css\\\\styles.css\"","toolAction":"\"Updating public/css/styles.css\"","toolSummary":"\"Updating public/css/styles.css\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
