{"step_index":240,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T19:22:19Z","content":"I have refined and verified the **StreamWave Serverless Media Platform** landing page, checkout simulation, accessibility features, and complete visitor journey.\n\n---\n\n### 🎨 Refined Features Summary\n\n1. **Full-Height Viewport Landing Hero (`/`)**:\n   - **Height & Centering**: `min-height: calc(100vh - 70px)` viewport flexbox centering.\n   - **Visual Contrast**: Dark background overlay gradient on top of high-resolution StreamWave artwork collage (`rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.88)`).\n   - **Call-to-Action Visibility**: Main heading (*\"Zimbabwe’s stories, music and movies — all in one place.\"*), supporting text, email field, and **`Get Started ›`** button are visible without excessive scrolling on desktop and mobile viewports.\n   - **Header Layout**: StreamWave brand logo image on left, restrained **Sign In** button on right.\n\n2. **Refined Checkout Experience (`/checkout`)**:\n   - **Selectable Payment Tabs**: EcoCash, Visa, and MasterCard options with keyboard tab support (`role=\"tab\"`, `aria-selected`).\n   - **Dynamic Step Sequences**: Demonstration steps render ONLY after selecting the respective payment option:\n     - *EcoCash*: Test mobile number `077 000 0000` with 3-step USSD push sequence.\n     - *Visa*: Masked test card `•••• •••• •••• 4242` with 3-step authorization sequence.\n     - *MasterCard*: Masked test card `•••• •••• •••• 4444` with 3-step authorization sequence.\n   - **Dual Demonstration Actions**:\n     - **`Simulate Successful Payment ($2.99)`** (Primary red button): Executes simulated authorization, receives `SW-DEMO-XXXXX` transaction reference, sets signed session cookie, and redirects to `/library`.\n     - **`Test Declined Payment State`** (Secondary button): Demonstrates simulated payment decline (issuer rejection), displays an error state box, and blocks session cookie issuance.\n   - **Anti-Duplicate Submission**: Buttons are disabled during active processing.\n   - **Transaction Reference**: Displays the backend-generated `SW-DEMO-XXXXX` referen\n<truncated 609 bytes>\n Verified Visitor Journey Flow\n\n```\n1. Landing Page (/) \n   └── User enters \"customer@example.co.zw\" & clicks [Get Started ›]\n       ▼\n2. Checkout Page (/checkout?email=customer@example.co.zw)\n   ├── Selects EcoCash / Visa / MasterCard tab\n   ├── Option A: Clicks [Test Declined Payment] ──► Displays Decline Error (No Cookie)\n   └── Option B: Clicks [Simulate Successful Payment]\n       ▼\n3. Simulated Payment Backend Processing (POST /api/demo-payment)\n   └── Generates \"SW-DEMO-XXXXX\" Ref ──► Sets Signed HTTP-Only Session Cookie\n       ▼\n4. Paid Member Library (/library)\n   ├── Header displays \"Member: customer@example.co.zw\"\n   ├── Browses catalogue, filters genres, plays 5-sec movie previews & music audio\n   └── Clicks [Sign Out] ──► Calls POST /api/logout ──► Clears Cookie ──► Redirects to (/)\n```\n\n---\n\n### 📁 Files Modified\n\n- **[`app.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/app.py)**: Added `simulate_decline` option to `DemoPaymentRequest` returning HTTP 400 on decline tests.\n- **[`public/index.html`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/index.html)**: Refined landing hero to full-height layout with restrained Sign In button.\n- **[`public/checkout.html`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/checkout.html)**: Added success & decline simulation buttons, step sequences, transaction reference display, and ARIA status regions.\n- **[`public/css/styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/css/styles.css)**: Added viewport centering, focus-visible styles, reduced-motion rules, and responsive boundaries.\n- **[`tests/test_api.py`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/tests/test_api.py)**: Added `test_simulated_payment_decline_rejected` covering payment decline responses.","truncated_fields":["content"]}
{"step_index":241,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T19:23:54Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\nConduct a security and technical audit of the StreamWave academic payment simulation and paid-library access.\r\n\r\nVerify and fix the following:\r\n\r\n1. No real payment provider or financial API is contacted.\r\n2. No mobile number, card number, expiry date or CVV is sent to the server.\r\n3. No sensitive payment information appears in logs, HTML storage, cookies or URLs.\r\n4. The backend accepts only EcoCash, Visa and MasterCard demonstration methods.\r\n5. Email addresses and request bodies have appropriate validation and maximum lengths.\r\n6. The demo membership cookie is signed and HTTP-only.\r\n7. Secure cookie mode is enabled on the Vercel HTTPS deployment.\r\n8. Cookie tampering causes access rejection.\r\n9. Expired or missing sessions cannot access `/library`.\r\n10. Protected catalogue endpoints reject unpaid access.\r\n11. Payment submission cannot create duplicate events from repeated clicks.\r\n12. Structured logs contain no secrets.\r\n13. `DEMO_SESSION_SECRET` is read from an environment variable and is never committed.\r\n14. The application does not rely on permanent writes to Vercel’s runtime filesystem.\r\n15. Existing five-second movie previews and music samples still work for demo-paid sessions.\r\n16. All existing and new automated tests pass.\r\n\r\nAdd a README section explaining:\r\n\r\n* This is a payment simulation.\r\n* No real transactions occur.\r\n* The access cookie represents demonstration membership only.\r\n* Static preview files are not DRM-protected.\r\n* Production integration would require an authorised payment gateway, database, private media storage, authenticated delivery and formal security review.\r\n\r\nReturn the actual audit findings, corrections made and final test results.\r\n\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-08-25T21:23:54+02:00.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
